n start the job when the vehicle is ready.</li><li>Add parts, labour and services in the card.</li></ul></div><div class="new-invoice-card"><strong>ⓘ &nbsp; New Invoice (No Job Card)</strong><p>Use this option for small jobs or quick services without creating a job card.</p><a class="btn btn-outline-primary" href="index.php?page=admin&amp;section=invoices-add">＋ New Invoice</a></div></aside></div></form>
